From b01d71125322bf4338d1969a87c2f4340166dfec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jt <jt@example.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:36:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: initialize QSA caches for AscendStore validation

Bind unified caches from actual specs and preserve page stride and aligned slice offsets. Reuse the QSA page-major capability to expose dense K/V token planes. Add explicit initialization-only mode with real backend registration and no external reuse until hybrid-state restore is implemented. Cover view bounds, layout, and connector lifecycle; record TP8 eager validation.

Signed-off-by: jt <jt@example.com>
